    "body": "<!--\r\nThank you for contributing to uv! To help us out with reviewing, please consider the following:\r\n\r\n- Does this pull request include a summary of the change? (See below.)\r\n- Does this pull request include a descriptive title?\r\n- Does this pull request include references to any relevant issues?\r\n-->\r\n\r\n## Summary\r\n\r\n<!-- What's the purpose of the change? What does it do, and why? -->\r\nUpdate `astral_async_zip` to [0.0.21](https://github.com/astral-sh/rs-async-zip/releases/tag/v0.0.21) and `astral_async_http_range_reader` to [0.12.0](https://github.com/astral-sh/async_http_range_reader/releases/tag/v0.12.0).\r\n\r\nThere isn’t an obvious, urgent need here, but both contain bugfixes and it’s been a while since they were released. It doesn’t look like any source-code changes are needed.\r\n\r\n## Test Plan\r\n\r\n<!-- How was it tested? -->\r\n```\r\n$ cargo nextest run -- --skip 'python_install::python_install_pyodide'\r\n```",
