    "body": "ARM64 GNU PGO builds intermittently fail when the runner runs out of memory and kills `rustc`. The instrumented fat-LTO build can exceed the physical memory available on a 32 GB runner.\n\nMove this job to a 64 GB runner to give the instrumented build more memory headroom.\n\nRelated to astral-sh/uv-dev#2124.\n",
    "closed_by": {
      "login": "zanieb",
      "id": 2586601,
      "node_id": "MDQ6VXNlcjI1ODY2MDE=",
      "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2586601?v=4",
      "gravatar_id": "",
      "url": "https://api.github.com/users/zanieb",
      "html_url": "https://github.com/zanieb",
