    },
    "body": "NetBSD wheels built by maturin can contain uppercase release suffixes such as `STABLE`. uv generates lowercase host tags, but retained the original case when parsing wheel filenames, causing compatible wheels to be rejected after a successful build. Normalize the shared release-and-architecture suffix when parsing platform tags so both spellings compare equally.\n\nFixes astral-sh/uv#22110.\n",
