    },
    "body": "`uv sync` can warn that a selected workspace member's entry points were skipped even when the member is installed. Members referenced through a workspace source are packaged by default without a `build-system`, but the warning requires one unconditionally. Use the same required-member packaging rule as dependency resolution, while retaining the warning for explicitly virtual members.\n\nRefs astral-sh/uv#22111.\n",
