    "body": "The no-hash `HashReader::finish` benchmarks regularly report wall-time changes on unrelated pull requests. Restrict both `finish_none` chunk sizes to CodSpeed simulation so they retain CPU regression coverage without adding noisy wall-time comparisons. The hashing cases still run in both modes.\n",
