      "patch_url": "https://github.com/astral-sh/uv/pull/22100.patch",
      "merged_at": null
    },
    "body": "Native ARM64 builds of uv currently prefer emulated x86-64 Python on Windows. Prefer native `aarch64` Python across Python versions, with `x86_64` ahead of 32-bit `x86` when no native distribution is available. Explicit architecture requests continue to select emulated Python.\n\nPorts astral-sh/uv-dev#2207 and adds the 0.13 breaking-change entry.\n\nLand astral-sh/uv#22098 and astral-sh/uv#22099 on `main` first, then bring them into the 0.13 release before landing this change. They provide the persistent `UV_PYTHON_ARCH=x86_64` opt-out and retain compatible x86-64 wheels for Windows ARM environment markers.\n",
    "closed_by": null,
