      "patch_url": "https://github.com/astral-sh/uv/pull/22098.patch",
      "merged_at": null
    },
    "body": "Selecting a Python architecture currently requires including it in each interpreter request, which is awkward with version-only project pins and requires users to specify a Python key instead. Add `UV_PYTHON_ARCH` to constrain interpreter discovery and managed downloads independently of the Python version. Explicit architecture requests and interpreter paths take precedence; `uv python list --all-arches` and `--all-platforms` still enumerate all requested platforms.\r\n\r\nPorts astral-sh/uv-dev#2213. This allows users to select `x86_64` to recover the current behavior after we the Windows ARM64 default changes in astral-sh/uv#22100.\r\n",
    "closed_by": null,
