      "merged_at": "2026-09-30T20:36:00Z"
    },
    "body": "New virtual environments on Python 3.10 and later omit `_virtualenv.py` and `_virtualenv.pth` by default. Python 3.9 and earlier retain the distutils configuration patch. Existing environments are left alone until recreated.\n\nRemove the preview gate, feature declaration, and unused `uv-virtualenv` preview dependency, and add the 0.13 migration note. The existing unknown-feature handling allows old `--preview-features no-distutils-patch` invocations to continue with a warning.\n\nFixes #20791. Targets `release/0.13.0` for #22092.\n",
