    "body": "Warning chains render hints after a blank line at column zero, visually separating the advice from the warning while the command continues. Add a nested hint layout in `uv-errors` and use it for warning chains so each hint follows immediately beneath its warning, with wrapped and explicit continuation lines aligned under the hint text.\n\nStacked on #22084.\n",
