      "merged_at": "2026-09-30T02:07:21Z"
    },
    "body": "We align HTTP cache policies within the payload buffer and access them directly after validation, removing a separate allocation and copy from every cache read. Extracting the payload reuses the same allocation.\n\nThe file adds up to 15 bytes of padding, covered by the CRC32. Policy validation is restricted to its own slice, and refreshes retain the entry ID check before overwriting the policy.\n",
