    "body": "Fixes #15413\r\n\r\n## Summary\r\n\r\nThe `tool.uv.cache-keys` documentation lives at `concepts/cache/#dynamic-metadata`\r\nbut was not linked from the `concepts/projects/config` page, making it hard to\r\ndiscover when configuring a project that uses dynamic metadata.\r\n\r\nAdded a cross-reference at the end of the `#### Dynamic metadata` subsection so\r\nusers configuring dynamic metadata projects (e.g., `setuptools-scm`,\r\n`requirements.txt`-based version) can easily find the cache-keys documentation.\r\n",
