      "patch_url": "https://github.com/astral-sh/uv/pull/22070.patch",
      "merged_at": "2026-09-29T17:09:00Z"
    },
    "body": "## Summary\n\nWhen a lockfile manifest contains only subtables, we write an empty `[manifest]` header even though the subtables already define their parent. Omit the header in this case and teach the fast lockfile parser to read the resulting implicit manifest.\n\nWe continue to write `[manifest]` when it contains direct entries. This changes the canonical output for lockfiles with only manifest dependency groups or dependency metadata; the lockfile contents are otherwise unchanged.\n\nPrerequisite for https://github.com/astral-sh/uv/pull/22010.\n",
