    "body": "## Summary\n\nExtend #22004 to omit compatible version constraints when the bound or a locked version is a prerelease. Every locked version must satisfy an omitted constraint.\n\nKeep source and index constraints, and constraints that opt a locked registry prerelease into the `explicit` policy. Under `if-necessary`, the resolver can still use an existing locked prerelease as a preference after its constraint is removed.\n",
