    "body": "Alternative to #22052. We refresh HTTP cache policies in place after 304 responses and use `.cache-v2` filenames without bumping cache buckets.\n\nOld and new clients maintain separate HTTP records and wheel archive links. Responses must be fetched once per format; pruning can evict source revisions used only by another client version.\n",
