    },
    "body": "We use `WheelFilename::cache_key()` for Windows wheel download, extraction, and metadata locks, limiting lock filenames to 69 characters, including `.lock`. This covers both PEP 658 metadata requests and the range-request fallback.\n\nThe `wheels-v7` and `sdists-v10` bumps remove the need to share lock filenames with older uv versions.\n",
