      "merged_at": "2026-09-30T02:07:18Z"
    },
    "body": "We derive `Serialize` for `Revision` and `Archive`, writing MessagePack arrays instead of maps. This removes the custom serializers and saves 15 bytes per source revision and 32 bytes per wheel archive record.\n\nThe `sdists-v10` and `wheels-v7` bumps remove the need to support older readers that cannot accept the added `size` field.\n",
