    "body": "## Summary\n\nThis reverts https://github.com/astral-sh/uv/pull/22051, i.e. reapplies https://github.com/astral-sh/uv/pull/21675.\n\n## Test Plan\n\nThe `cached_client/revalidate_shared` benchmark in #22054 measures 568.5 ms here versus 47.1 ms on the baseline, a 12.1× slowdown. With #22057 applied, it measures 28.1 ms. These are local Criterion means on a native Docker ext4 volume (Linux 7.0.12, aarch64, Rust 1.98.1, 8 CPUs), for 500 revalidations with 256 KiB payloads at concurrency 50.\n",
