    "body": "Reverts https://github.com/astral-sh/uv/pull/21675 while we investigate severe cache-revalidation stalls on ext4 filesystems.\n\nThe change moved cache serialization, temporary-file creation, and atomic renames into blocking tasks, changing how filesystem operations can overlap. We have not confirmed that this caused the stalls or that reverting it resolves them. This restores the previous scheduling as a precaution.\n",
