    },
    "body": "For a root package recorded with `source = { editable = \".\" }`, we emit its member path as `/project` but its source and node IDs as `/project/`.\n\nResolve `.` and empty paths to the workspace root in the shared metadata helper, so root paths use the same spelling throughout `uv workspace metadata` and `uv tree --format json`.\n",
