      "diff_url": "https://github.com/astral-sh/uv/pull/22049.diff",
      "patch_url": "https://github.com/astral-sh/uv/pull/22049.patch",
      "merged_at": "2026-09-29T17:28:08Z"
    },
    "body": "We resolve requirements such as `package>1.0.dev0` or `package>1.0a1` to `1.0.post0`, but installed-package checks reject that version. As a result, `uv pip install --strict` can warn about the package it just installed, and `uv pip check` reports it as incompatible.\n\nLimit `>V`'s post-release exclusion to post-releases of V itself. For example, `>1.0a1` still excludes `1.0a1.post0`, but accepts `1.0.post0`. This matches the resolver and [packaging's corresponding fix](https://github.com/pypa/packaging/pull/1141).\n",
    "closed_by": {
      "login": "charliermarsh",
      "id": 1309177,
