    "body": "## Summary\n\nRecord dependency group metadata for workspace members in `uv.lock`, so frozen commands can select a compatible Python interpreter without reading member manifests:\n\n```toml\n[manifest.group-metadata]\nmember = { docs = { requires-python = \">=3.13\" } }\n```\n\nThe recorded Python requirement includes bounds inherited through `include-group`. Groups without metadata are omitted, and changing a recorded requirement makes the lockfile stale. Member default groups are recorded separately in `[manifest.default-groups]`.\n\nThe group metadata is recorded in lockfile revision 5 alongside member defaults. Older lockfiles remain valid without a group metadata freshness check. Requirements for non-project workspace roots are not yet recorded.\n",
