    "body": "I'm using this issue to keep track of the wheel variants PRs for the implementation of PEP 815 and following PRs in preview. This issue will be updated as new parts are added.\n\nWe need to break https://github.com/astral-sh/uv/pull/12203 into pieces.\n\nPEP 825\n- [ ] Variant labels (wheel filenames) https://github.com/astral-sh/uv/pull/22039\n- [ ] Variant markers\n- [ ] Static file input (substitute for providers for end-to-end testing PEP 825)\n- [ ] Variant compatibility\n- [ ] Implied markers for variant compatibility?\n\nPEP XXXX: Providers\n- [ ] Static providers\n- [ ] Implement a provider frontend\n- [ ] Implement a \"vendored\" CUDA provider\n- [ ] CLI options for the provider opt-in\n- [ ] ABI dependencies (low prio, too complex for starters)",
