    },
    "body": "`uv check` currently downloads standalone ty releases from `releases.astral.sh`, with a GitHub fallback. Resolve default, pinned, latest, and constrained versions from public PyPI and extract the native executable from a compatible wheel without requiring Python.\n\nKeep standalone acquisition independent of dependency indexes and `--find-links`. Require advertised hashes, verify wheel contents before installation, and cache executables by artifact URL and hashes. `TY` overrides and locked dependencies retain their precedence.\n\n`Cargo.lock` only gains dependency edges for `uv-bin-install`; no dependency versions change.\n",
    "closed_by": null,
