    "body": "This PR contains the following updates:\n\n| Package | Type | Update | Change | [Age](https://docs.renovatebot.com/merge-confidence/) | [Confidence](https://docs.renovatebot.com/merge-confidence/) |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| [maturin](https://redirect.github.com/PyO3/maturin) |  | minor | `v1.14.1` → `v1.15.0` | ![age](https://developer.mend.io/api/mc/badges/age/github-releases/PyO3%2fmaturin/v1.15.0?slim=true) | ![confidence](https://developer.mend.io/api/mc/badges/confidence/github-releases/PyO3%2fmaturin/v1.14.1/v1.15.0?slim=true) |\n| [maturin](https://redirect.github.com/pyo3/maturin) ([changelog](https://maturin.rs/changelog.html)) | uses-with | minor | `v1.14.1` → `v1.15.0` | ![age](https://developer.mend.io/api/mc/badges/age/pypi/maturin/1.15.0?slim=true) | ![confidence](https://developer.mend.io/api/mc/badges/confidence/pypi/maturin/1.14.1/1.15.0?slim=true) |\n\n---\n\n> [!WARNING]\n> Some dependencies could not be looked up. Check the [Dependency Dashboard](../issues/2658) for more information.\n\n---\n\n### Release Notes\n\n<details>\n<summary>PyO3/maturin (maturin)</summary>\n\n### [`v1.15.0`](https://redirect.github.com/PyO3/maturin/releases/tag/v1.15.0)\n\n[Compare Source](https://redirect.github.com/PyO3/maturin/compare/v1.14.1...v1.15.0)\n\n##### What's Changed\n\n- set `UV_PYTHON` when running `maturin develop` with uv by [@&#8203;davidhewitt](https://redirect.github.com/davidhewitt) in [#&#8203;3236](https://redirect.github.com/PyO3/maturin/pull/3236)\n- Set UID and GID headers in pax by [@&#8203;konstin](https://redirect.github.com/konstin) in [#&#8203;3241](https://redirect.github.com/PyO3/maturin/pull/3241)\n- \\[pre-commit.ci] pre-commit autoupdate by [@&#8203;pre-commit-ci](https://redirect.github.com/pre-commit-ci)\\[bot] in [#&#8203;3238](https://redirect.github.com/PyO3/maturin/pull/3238)\n- Replace unguarded panics with explicit errors on fallible input by [@&#8203;messense](https://redirect.github.com/messense) in [#&#8203;3242](https://redirect.github.com/PyO3/maturin/pull/3242)\n- Harden PEP 517 build-wheel and fix unreachable OIDC 404 fallback by [@&#8203;messense](https://redirect.github.com/messense) in [#&#8203;3244](https://redirect.github.com/PyO3/maturin/pull/3244)\n- docs: add pdfcrate and quebec to examples by [@&#8203;ratazzi](https://redirect.github.com/ratazzi) in [#&#8203;3245](https://redirect.github.com/PyO3/maturin/pull/3245)\n- Fix abi3t PyModExport entrypoint check by [@&#8203;messense](https://redirect.github.com/messense) in [#&#8203;3246](https://redirect.github.com/PyO3/maturin/pull/3246)\n- \\[pre-commit.ci] pre-commit autoupdate by [@&#8203;pre-commit-ci](https://redirect.github.com/pre-commit-ci)\\[bot] in [#&#8203;3247](https://redirect.github.com/PyO3/maturin/pull/3247)\n- fix `maturin build --pgo -i <version>` with `uv` install by [@&#8203;davidhewitt](https://redirect.github.com/davidhewitt) in [#&#8203;3237](https://redirect.github.com/PyO3/maturin/pull/3237)\n- refactor: apply some mechanical cleanups by [@&#8203;messense](https://redirect.github.com/messense) in [#&#8203;3250](https://redirect.github.com/PyO3/maturin/pull/3250)\n- refactor: BuildOrchestrator pipeline deduplication by [@&#8203;messense](https://redirect.github.com/messense) in [#&#8203;3251](https://redirect.github.com/PyO3/maturin/pull/3251)\n- refactor: improve context and environment hygiene by [@&#8203;messense](https://redirect.github.com/messense) in [#&#8203;3252](https://redirect.github.com/PyO3/maturin/pull/3252)\n- fix(ci): honor \\~= and ==X.\\* in requires-python for generate-ci by [@&#8203;teddytennant](https://redirect.github.com/teddytennant) in [#&#8203;3249](https://redirect.github.com/PyO3/maturin/pull/3249)\n- refactor: type cleanup for options, tags, and wheel metadata by [@&#8203;messense](https://redirect.github.com/messense) in [#&#8203;3253](https://redirect.github.com/PyO3/maturin/pull/3253)\n- refactor: InstallDest, single BridgeModel, and ui output facade by [@&#8203;messense](https://redirect.github.com/messense) in [#&#8203;3254](https://redirect.github.com/PyO3/maturin/pull/3254)\n- Don’t specify generate-import-lib for PyO3 0.29 by [@&#8203;musicinmybrain](https://redirect.github.com/musicinmybrain) in [#&#8203;3258](https://redirect.github.com/PyO3/maturin/pull/3258)\n- \\[pre-commit.ci] pre-commit autoupdate by [@&#8203;pre-commit-ci](https://redirect.github.com/pre-commit-ci)\\[bot] in [#&#8203;3259](https://redirect.github.com/PyO3/maturin/pull/3259)\n- ci: fix clippy errors on rust 1.97 by [@&#8203;davidhewitt](https://redirect.github.com/davidhewitt) in [#&#8203;3263](https://redirect.github.com/PyO3/maturin/pull/3263)\n- refactor build so that pgo is part of normal pathway by [@&#8203;davidhewitt](https://redirect.github.com/davidhewitt) in [#&#8203;3257](https://redirect.github.com/PyO3/maturin/pull/3257)\n- fix: verify bindings detection with cargo tree in workspaces by [@&#8203;messense](https://redirect.github.com/messense) in [#&#8203;3264](https://redirect.github.com/PyO3/maturin/pull/3264)\n- fix: harden cargo tree verification of bindings detection by [@&#8203;messense](https://redirect.github.com/messense) in [#&#8203;3266](https://redirect.github.com/PyO3/maturin/pull/3266)\n- ci: cut test wall time without losing coverage by [@&#8203;messense](https://redirect.github.com/messense) in [#&#8203;3267](https://redirect.github.com/PyO3/maturin/pull/3267)\n- test: share cargo target dirs per fixture family by [@&#8203;messense](https://redirect.github.com/messense) in [#&#8203;3268](https://redirect.github.com/PyO3/maturin/pull/3268)\n- ci: cut fixed setup overhead in test jobs by [@&#8203;messense](https://redirect.github.com/messense) in [#&#8203;3269](https://redirect.github.com/PyO3/maturin/pull/3269)\n- feat: support --pgo for maturin develop by [@&#8203;messense](https://redirect.github.com/messense) in [#&#8203;3270](https://redirect.github.com/PyO3/maturin/pull/3270)\n- feat: support MATURIN\\_PGO env var to activate --pgo by [@&#8203;messense](https://redirect.github.com/messense) in [#&#8203;3271](https://redirect.github.com/PyO3/maturin/pull/3271)\n- \\[pre-commit.ci] pre-commit autoupdate by [@&#8203;pre-commit-ci](https://redirect.github.com/pre-commit-ci)\\[bot] in [#&#8203;3272](https://redirect.github.com/PyO3/maturin/pull/3272)\n- feat: type the bindings input with a single-source-of-truth enum by [@&#8203;messense](https://redirect.github.com/messense) in [#&#8203;3273](https://redirect.github.com/PyO3/maturin/pull/3273)\n- Don't force export of the PyInit\\_{module\\_name} in UniFfi mode by [@&#8203;badboy](https://redirect.github.com/badboy) in [#&#8203;3275](https://redirect.github.com/PyO3/maturin/pull/3275)\n- \\[pre-commit.ci] pre-commit autoupdate by [@&#8203;pre-commit-ci](https://redirect.github.com/pre-commit-ci)\\[bot] in [#&#8203;3279](https://redirect.github.com/PyO3/maturin/pull/3279)\n- switch musllinux images to musllinux\\_1\\_2 as musllinux\\_1\\_1 is EOL by [@&#8203;Joshix-1](https://redirect.github.com/Joshix-1) in [#&#8203;3280](https://redirect.github.com/PyO3/maturin/pull/3280)\n- fix(generate-stubs): write stubs into the module's package directory by [@&#8203;jonasdedden](https://redirect.github.com/jonasdedden) in [#&#8203;3282](https://redirect.github.com/PyO3/maturin/pull/3282)\n- \\[pre-commit.ci] pre-commit autoupdate by [@&#8203;pre-commit-ci](https://redirect.github.com/pre-commit-ci)\\[bot] in [#&#8203;3286](https://redirect.github.com/PyO3/maturin/pull/3286)\n- Fix group not cwd by [@&#8203;kraktus](https://redirect.github.com/kraktus) in [#&#8203;3284](https://redirect.github.com/PyO3/maturin/pull/3284)\n- docs: document missing \\[tool.maturin] config fields by [@&#8203;teddytennant](https://redirect.github.com/teddytennant) in [#&#8203;3287](https://redirect.github.com/PyO3/maturin/pull/3287)\n- \\[pre-commit.ci] pre-commit autoupdate by [@&#8203;pre-commit-ci](https://redirect.github.com/pre-commit-ci)\\[bot] in [#&#8203;3288](https://redirect.github.com/PyO3/maturin/pull/3288)\n- docs: fix cross compiling heading level by [@&#8203;BD103](https://redirect.github.com/BD103) in [#&#8203;3290](https://redirect.github.com/PyO3/maturin/pull/3290)\n- \\[pre-commit.ci] pre-commit autoupdate by [@&#8203;pre-commit-ci](https://redirect.github.com/pre-commit-ci)\\[bot] in [#&#8203;3292](https://redirect.github.com/PyO3/maturin/pull/3292)\n- Release v1.15.0 by [@&#8203;messense](https://redirect.github.com/messense) in [#&#8203;3294](https://redirect.github.com/PyO3/maturin/pull/3294)\n\n##### New Contributors\n\n- [@&#8203;ratazzi](https://redirect.github.com/ratazzi) made their first contribution in [#&#8203;3245](https://redirect.github.com/PyO3/maturin/pull/3245)\n- [@&#8203;teddytennant](https://redirect.github.com/teddytennant) made their first contribution in [#&#8203;3249](https://redirect.github.com/PyO3/maturin/pull/3249)\n- [@&#8203;jonasdedden](https://redirect.github.com/jonasdedden) made their first contribution in [#&#8203;3282](https://redirect.github.com/PyO3/maturin/pull/3282)\n- [@&#8203;kraktus](https://redirect.github.com/kraktus) made their first contribution in [#&#8203;3284](https://redirect.github.com/PyO3/maturin/pull/3284)\n- [@&#8203;BD103](https://redirect.github.com/BD103) made their first contribution in [#&#8203;3290](https://redirect.github.com/PyO3/maturin/pull/3290)\n\n**Full Changelog**: <https://github.com/PyO3/maturin/compare/v1.14.1...v1.15.0>\n\n</details>\n\n<details>\n<summary>pyo3/maturin (maturin)</summary>\n\n### [`v1.15.0`](https://redirect.github.com/pyo3/maturin/blob/HEAD/Changelog.md#1150)\n\n[Compare Source](https://redirect.github.com/pyo3/maturin/compare/v1.14.1...v1.15.0)\n\n- Set `UV_PYTHON` when running `maturin develop` with uv ([#&#8203;3236](https://redirect.github.com/pyo3/maturin/pull/3236))\n- Set UID and GID headers in pax ([#&#8203;3241](https://redirect.github.com/pyo3/maturin/pull/3241))\n- Replace unguarded panics with explicit errors on fallible input ([#&#8203;3242](https://redirect.github.com/pyo3/maturin/pull/3242))\n- Harden PEP 517 build-wheel and fix unreachable OIDC 404 fallback ([#&#8203;3244](https://redirect.github.com/pyo3/maturin/pull/3244))\n- Fix abi3t PyModExport entrypoint check ([#&#8203;3246](https://redirect.github.com/pyo3/maturin/pull/3246))\n- Fix `maturin build --pgo -i <version>` with `uv` install ([#&#8203;3237](https://redirect.github.com/pyo3/maturin/pull/3237))\n- Refactor: apply some mechanical cleanups ([#&#8203;3250](https://redirect.github.com/pyo3/maturin/pull/3250))\n- Refactor: BuildOrchestrator pipeline deduplication ([#&#8203;3251](https://redirect.github.com/pyo3/maturin/pull/3251))\n- Refactor: improve context and environment hygiene ([#&#8203;3252](https://redirect.github.com/pyo3/maturin/pull/3252))\n- Fix(ci): honor \\~= and ==X.\\* in requires-python for generate-ci ([#&#8203;3249](https://redirect.github.com/pyo3/maturin/pull/3249))\n- Refactor: type cleanup for options, tags, and wheel metadata ([#&#8203;3253](https://redirect.github.com/pyo3/maturin/pull/3253))\n- Refactor: InstallDest, single BridgeModel, and ui output facade ([#&#8203;3254](https://redirect.github.com/pyo3/maturin/pull/3254))\n- Don’t specify generate-import-lib for PyO3 0.29 ([#&#8203;3258](https://redirect.github.com/pyo3/maturin/pull/3258))\n- Refactor build so that pgo is part of normal pathway ([#&#8203;3257](https://redirect.github.com/pyo3/maturin/pull/3257))\n- Fix: verify bindings detection with cargo tree in workspaces ([#&#8203;3264](https://redirect.github.com/pyo3/maturin/pull/3264))\n- Fix: harden cargo tree verification of bindings detection ([#&#8203;3266](https://redirect.github.com/pyo3/maturin/pull/3266))\n- Feat: support --pgo for maturin develop ([#&#8203;3270](https://redirect.github.com/pyo3/maturin/pull/3270))\n- Feat: support `MATURIN_PGO` env var to activate --pgo ([#&#8203;3271](https://redirect.github.com/pyo3/maturin/pull/3271))\n- Docs: correct crate feature documentation; remove stale clippy allow\n- Fix: deduplicate SBOM includes across full merged list, preserving first-seen order\n- Feat: type the bindings input with a single-source-of-truth enum ([#&#8203;3273](https://redirect.github.com/pyo3/maturin/pull/3273))\n- Don't force export of the `PyInit_{module_name}` in UniFfi mode ([#&#8203;3275](https://redirect.github.com/pyo3/maturin/pull/3275))\n- Switch musllinux images to `musllinux_1_2` as `musllinux_1_1` is EOL ([#&#8203;3280](https://redirect.github.com/pyo3/maturin/pull/3280))\n- Fix(generate-stubs): write stubs into the module's package directory ([#&#8203;3282](https://redirect.github.com/pyo3/maturin/pull/3282))\n- Fix group not cwd ([#&#8203;3284](https://redirect.github.com/pyo3/maturin/pull/3284))\n- Docs: document missing \\[tool.maturin] config fields ([#&#8203;3287](https://redirect.github.com/pyo3/maturin/pull/3287))\n- Update cargo-zigbuild & cargo-xwin to 0.23.1\n\n</details>\n\n---\n\n### Configuration\n\n📅 **Schedule**: (UTC)\n\n- Branch creation\n  - Between 12:00 AM and 03:59 AM, only on Monday (`* 0-3 * * 1`)\n- Automerge\n  - At any time (no schedule defined)\n\n🚦 **Automerge**: Disabled by config. Please merge this manually once you are satisfied.\n\n♻ **Rebasing**: Whenever PR becomes conflicted, or you tick the rebase/retry checkbox.\n\n🔕 **Ignore**: Close this PR and you won't be reminded about these updates again.\n\n---\n\n - [ ] <!-- rebase-check -->If you want to rebase/retry this PR, check this box\n\n---\n\nThis PR was generated by [Mend Renovate](https://mend.io/renovate/). View the [repository job log](https://developer.mend.io/github/astral-sh/uv).\n<!--renovate-debug:eyJjcmVhdGVkSW5WZXIiOiI0NC4xMTIuMCIsInVwZGF0ZWRJblZlciI6IjQ0LjExMi4wIiwidGFyZ2V0QnJhbmNoIjoibWFpbiIsImxhYmVscyI6WyJidWlsZDpza2lwLWRvY2tlciIsImJ1aWxkOnNraXAtcmVsZWFzZSIsImludGVybmFsIl19-->\n",
