    "body": "This PR contains the following updates:\n\n| Package | Type | Update | Change | Pending |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| [reqsign](https://redirect.github.com/apache/opendal-reqsign) | workspace.dependencies | patch | `0.20.3` → `0.20.6` | `0.20.7` |\n\n---\n\n> [!WARNING]\n> Some dependencies could not be looked up. Check the [Dependency Dashboard](../issues/2658) for more information.\n\n---\n\n### Release Notes\n\n<details>\n<summary>apache/opendal-reqsign (reqsign)</summary>\n\n### [`v0.20.6`](https://redirect.github.com/apache/reqsign/releases/tag/v0.20.6)\n\n[Compare Source](https://redirect.github.com/apache/opendal-reqsign/compare/v0.20.5...v0.20.6)\n\nApache OpenDAL reqsign 0.20.6 has been released.\n\nSource release artifacts are available from the Apache release distribution:\n<https://dist.apache.org/repos/dist/release/opendal/reqsign-0.20.6/>\n\nVote and result:\n\n- Vote: <https://redirect.github.com/apache/opendal-reqsign/discussions/845>\n- Result: <https://redirect.github.com/apache/opendal-reqsign/discussions/850>\n\nNotable changes:\n\n- Add automatic S3 Express session configuration from directory bucket names.\n- Add maximum-allowed S3 Express sessions, IAM signing, and custom CreateSession endpoints.\n- Deduplicate concurrent signer credential refreshes through the shared credential cache.\n- Add live AWS credential-provider coverage for the supported default provider chain.\n\nCrate versions:\n\n- reqsign: 0.20.6\n- reqsign-core: 3.3.1\n- reqsign-aliyun-oss: 3.1.5\n- reqsign-aws-core: 3.1.1\n- reqsign-aws-v4: 3.3.0\n- reqsign-aws-v4a: 3.0.5\n- reqsign-azure-storage: 3.2.1\n- reqsign-command-execute-tokio: 3.0.6\n- reqsign-file-read-tokio: 3.0.6\n- reqsign-google: 3.1.1\n- reqsign-http-send-reqwest: 4.0.6\n- reqsign-huaweicloud-obs: 3.0.6\n- reqsign-oracle: 3.0.6\n- reqsign-tencent-cos: 3.0.6\n- reqsign-volcengine-tos: 3.1.2\n\n### [`v0.20.5`](https://redirect.github.com/apache/reqsign/releases/tag/v0.20.5)\n\n[Compare Source](https://redirect.github.com/apache/opendal-reqsign/compare/v0.20.4...v0.20.5)\n\nApache OpenDAL Reqsign 0.20.5\n\nEmergency patch release. Final tag for the voted candidate `v0.20.5-rc.1`.\n\n- Vote: <https://redirect.github.com/apache/opendal-reqsign/discussions/826>\n- Result: <https://redirect.github.com/apache/opendal-reqsign/discussions/827>\n- Source release: <https://dist.apache.org/repos/dist/release/opendal/reqsign-0.20.5/>\n\n### [`v0.20.4`](https://redirect.github.com/apache/reqsign/releases/tag/v0.20.4)\n\n[Compare Source](https://redirect.github.com/apache/opendal-reqsign/compare/v0.20.3...v0.20.4)\n\nApache OpenDAL reqsign 0.20.4 has been released.\n\nSource release artifacts are available from the Apache release distribution:\n<https://dist.apache.org/repos/dist/release/opendal/reqsign-0.20.4/>\n\nNotable changes:\n\n- Add AWS SigV4a header signing and query presigning through dedicated aws-core and aws-v4a crates.\n- Add explicit AWS profile selection across the default credential provider and prefer it over AWS\\_PROFILE.\n- Add presigned URL support for Volcengine TOS.\n- Migrate Rust crate releases to crates.io Trusted Publishing with GitHub OIDC.\n\nCrate versions:\n\n- reqsign: 0.20.4\n- reqsign-core: 3.2.1\n- reqsign-aliyun-oss: 3.1.3\n- reqsign-aws-core: 3.0.3\n- reqsign-aws-v4: 3.1.0\n- reqsign-aws-v4a: 3.0.3\n- reqsign-azure-storage: 3.1.2\n- reqsign-command-execute-tokio: 3.0.4\n- reqsign-file-read-tokio: 3.0.4\n- reqsign-google: 3.0.4\n- reqsign-http-send-reqwest: 4.0.4\n- reqsign-huaweicloud-obs: 3.0.4\n- reqsign-oracle: 3.0.4\n- reqsign-tencent-cos: 3.0.4\n- reqsign-volcengine-tos: 3.1.0\n\n</details>\n\n---\n\n### Configuration\n\n📅 **Schedule**: (UTC)\n\n- Branch creation\n  - Between 12:00 AM and 03:59 AM, only on Monday (`* 0-3 * * 1`)\n- Automerge\n  - At any time (no schedule defined)\n\n🚦 **Automerge**: Disabled by config. Please merge this manually once you are satisfied.\n\n♻ **Rebasing**: Whenever PR becomes conflicted, or you tick the rebase/retry checkbox.\n\n🔕 **Ignore**: Close this PR and you won't be reminded about this update again.\n\n---\n\n - [ ] <!-- rebase-check -->If you want to rebase/retry this PR, check this box\n\n---\n\nThis PR was generated by [Mend Renovate](https://mend.io/renovate/). View the [repository job log](https://developer.mend.io/github/astral-sh/uv).\n<!--renovate-debug:eyJjcmVhdGVkSW5WZXIiOiI0NC4xMTIuMCIsInVwZGF0ZWRJblZlciI6IjQ0LjExMi4wIiwidGFyZ2V0QnJhbmNoIjoibWFpbiIsImxhYmVscyI6WyJidWlsZDpza2lwLWRvY2tlciIsImJ1aWxkOnNraXAtcmVsZWFzZSIsImludGVybmFsIl19-->\n",
