    "body": "This PR contains the following updates:\n\n| Package | Type | Update | Change |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| [flate2](https://redirect.github.com/rust-lang/flate2-rs) | workspace.dependencies | patch | `1.1.9` → `1.1.10` |\n\n---\n\n> [!WARNING]\n> Some dependencies could not be looked up. Check the [Dependency Dashboard](../issues/2658) for more information.\n\n---\n\n### Release Notes\n\n<details>\n<summary>rust-lang/flate2-rs (flate2)</summary>\n\n### [`v1.1.10`](https://redirect.github.com/rust-lang/flate2-rs/releases/tag/1.1.10)\n\n[Compare Source](https://redirect.github.com/rust-lang/flate2-rs/compare/1.1.9...1.1.10)\n\n#### What's Changed\n\n- feat: reuse zlib's decoder buffer by [@&#8203;Vaiz](https://redirect.github.com/Vaiz) in [#&#8203;532](https://redirect.github.com/rust-lang/flate2-rs/pull/532)\n- feat: add reset method for read::GzDecoder and buffered::GzDecoder by [@&#8203;Vaiz](https://redirect.github.com/Vaiz) in [#&#8203;534](https://redirect.github.com/rust-lang/flate2-rs/pull/534)\n- Drop cloudflare-zlib by [@&#8203;kornelski](https://redirect.github.com/kornelski) in [#&#8203;539](https://redirect.github.com/rust-lang/flate2-rs/pull/539)\n- Add a wrapper for the `Crc` struct by [@&#8203;MikkelPaulson](https://redirect.github.com/MikkelPaulson) in [#&#8203;540](https://redirect.github.com/rust-lang/flate2-rs/pull/540)\n- Bump miniz\\_oxide to 0.9 by [@&#8203;oscargus](https://redirect.github.com/oscargus) in [#&#8203;543](https://redirect.github.com/rust-lang/flate2-rs/pull/543)\n- Upgrade miniz\\_oxide and add unit tests of the different flush kinds by [@&#8203;fintelia](https://redirect.github.com/fintelia) in [#&#8203;498](https://redirect.github.com/rust-lang/flate2-rs/pull/498)\n- Fix infinite loop in writing gzip header/footer by [@&#8203;Shnatsel](https://redirect.github.com/Shnatsel) in [#&#8203;547](https://redirect.github.com/rust-lang/flate2-rs/pull/547)\n- test: generate corrupt gzip fixture at runtime by [@&#8203;nanookclaw](https://redirect.github.com/nanookclaw) in [#&#8203;550](https://redirect.github.com/rust-lang/flate2-rs/pull/550)\n- Reject oversized gzip extra fields by [@&#8203;Byron](https://redirect.github.com/Byron) in [#&#8203;553](https://redirect.github.com/rust-lang/flate2-rs/pull/553)\n- Reject incomplete deflate streams at EOF by [@&#8203;Guflly](https://redirect.github.com/Guflly) in [#&#8203;556](https://redirect.github.com/rust-lang/flate2-rs/pull/556)\n- Include `README.md` in a private module by [@&#8203;bushrat011899](https://redirect.github.com/bushrat011899) in [#&#8203;562](https://redirect.github.com/rust-lang/flate2-rs/pull/562)\n- Add `no_std` support using nightly `alloc_io` by [@&#8203;bushrat011899](https://redirect.github.com/bushrat011899) in [#&#8203;559](https://redirect.github.com/rust-lang/flate2-rs/pull/559)\n- Update `get_mut()` documentation to make clear how 'inner\\` can be used by [@&#8203;Byron](https://redirect.github.com/Byron) in [#&#8203;558](https://redirect.github.com/rust-lang/flate2-rs/pull/558)\n\n#### New Contributors\n\n- [@&#8203;Vaiz](https://redirect.github.com/Vaiz) made their first contribution in [#&#8203;532](https://redirect.github.com/rust-lang/flate2-rs/pull/532)\n- [@&#8203;MikkelPaulson](https://redirect.github.com/MikkelPaulson) made their first contribution in [#&#8203;540](https://redirect.github.com/rust-lang/flate2-rs/pull/540)\n- [@&#8203;oscargus](https://redirect.github.com/oscargus) made their first contribution in [#&#8203;543](https://redirect.github.com/rust-lang/flate2-rs/pull/543)\n- [@&#8203;nanookclaw](https://redirect.github.com/nanookclaw) made their first contribution in [#&#8203;550](https://redirect.github.com/rust-lang/flate2-rs/pull/550)\n- [@&#8203;Guflly](https://redirect.github.com/Guflly) made their first contribution in [#&#8203;556](https://redirect.github.com/rust-lang/flate2-rs/pull/556)\n- [@&#8203;bushrat011899](https://redirect.github.com/bushrat011899) made their first contribution in [#&#8203;562](https://redirect.github.com/rust-lang/flate2-rs/pull/562)\n\n**Full Changelog**: <https://github.com/rust-lang/flate2-rs/compare/1.1.9...1.1.10>\n\n</details>\n\n---\n\n### Configuration\n\n📅 **Schedule**: (UTC)\n\n- Branch creation\n  - Between 12:00 AM and 03:59 AM, only on Monday (`* 0-3 * * 1`)\n- Automerge\n  - At any time (no schedule defined)\n\n🚦 **Automerge**: Disabled by config. Please merge this manually once you are satisfied.\n\n♻ **Rebasing**: Whenever PR becomes conflicted, or you tick the rebase/retry checkbox.\n\n🔕 **Ignore**: Close this PR and you won't be reminded about this update again.\n\n---\n\n - [ ] <!-- rebase-check -->If you want to rebase/retry this PR, check this box\n\n---\n\nThis PR was generated by [Mend Renovate](https://mend.io/renovate/). View the [repository job log](https://developer.mend.io/github/astral-sh/uv).\n<!--renovate-debug:eyJjcmVhdGVkSW5WZXIiOiI0NC4xMTIuMCIsInVwZGF0ZWRJblZlciI6IjQ0LjExMi4wIiwidGFyZ2V0QnJhbmNoIjoibWFpbiIsImxhYmVscyI6WyJidWlsZDpza2lwLWRvY2tlciIsImJ1aWxkOnNraXAtcmVsZWFzZSIsImludGVybmFsIl19-->\n",
