    "body": "This PR contains the following updates:\n\n| Package | Type | Update | Change | Pending |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| [azure/login](https://redirect.github.com/azure/login) | action | patch | `v3.0.1` → `v3.0.2` | `v3.1.0` |\n\n---\n\n> [!WARNING]\n> Some dependencies could not be looked up. Check the [Dependency Dashboard](../issues/2658) for more information.\n\n---\n\n### Release Notes\n\n<details>\n<summary>azure/login (azure/login)</summary>\n\n### [`v3.0.2`](https://redirect.github.com/Azure/login/releases/tag/v3.0.2): Azure Login Action v3.0.2\n\n[Compare Source](https://redirect.github.com/azure/login/compare/v3.0.1...v3.0.2)\n\n##### What's Changed\n\n##### Security & hardening\n\n- **Refactor PowerShell login to a static `param()`-bound script** — eliminates string-interpolation in the AzPS login path so credential/config values can never be re-parsed as PowerShell (injection-safe by construction) by [@&#8203;MaddyMicrosoft](https://redirect.github.com/MaddyMicrosoft) in [Azure#607](https://redirect.github.com/Azure/login/pull/607)\n- **Pin third-party GitHub Actions to commit SHAs** — supply-chain hardening for the CI/release workflows by [@&#8203;MaddyMicrosoft](https://redirect.github.com/MaddyMicrosoft) in [Azure#615](https://redirect.github.com/Azure/login/pull/615)\n- **Add admin-gated Release workflow** — reproducible, approval-gated release + rollback pipeline by [@&#8203;MaddyMicrosoft](https://redirect.github.com/MaddyMicrosoft) in [Azure#610](https://redirect.github.com/Azure/login/pull/610)\n\n##### Telemetry\n\n- **Emit the real action ref in telemetry via `GITHUB_ACTION_REF`** — corrects the previously stale hard-coded value so usage reports the version consumers actually pin by [@&#8203;MaddyMicrosoft](https://redirect.github.com/MaddyMicrosoft) in [Azure#614](https://redirect.github.com/Azure/login/pull/614)\n\n##### Dependencies\n\n- Cap `@actions/exec` and `@actions/core` below the ESM-only 3.x majors (keeps the CommonJS `ncc` build working) by [@&#8203;MaddyMicrosoft](https://redirect.github.com/MaddyMicrosoft) in [Azure#628](https://redirect.github.com/Azure/login/pull/628)\n- Harden Dependabot config for the CommonJS `ncc` build by [@&#8203;MaddyMicrosoft](https://redirect.github.com/MaddyMicrosoft) in [Azure#622](https://redirect.github.com/Azure/login/pull/622)\n- Bump the github-actions group across 1 directory with 7 updates by [@&#8203;MaddyMicrosoft](https://redirect.github.com/MaddyMicrosoft) in [Azure#621](https://redirect.github.com/Azure/login/pull/621)\n- Bump `uuid` and `@actions/core` by [@&#8203;dependabot](https://redirect.github.com/dependabot) in [Azure#589](https://redirect.github.com/Azure/login/pull/589)\n- Bump `brace-expansion` from 1.1.12 to 1.1.18 by [@&#8203;dependabot](https://redirect.github.com/dependabot) in [Azure#616](https://redirect.github.com/Azure/login/pull/616)\n- Bump `picomatch` from 2.3.1 to 2.3.2 by [@&#8203;dependabot](https://redirect.github.com/dependabot) in [Azure#582](https://redirect.github.com/Azure/login/pull/582)\n\n##### Maintenance & docs\n\n- Cleanup `package.json` and Dependabot config by [@&#8203;MaddyMicrosoft](https://redirect.github.com/MaddyMicrosoft) in [Azure#608](https://redirect.github.com/Azure/login/pull/608)\n- Workflows/CI hygiene by [@&#8203;MaddyMicrosoft](https://redirect.github.com/MaddyMicrosoft) in [Azure#609](https://redirect.github.com/Azure/login/pull/609)\n- Docs uplift by [@&#8203;MaddyMicrosoft](https://redirect.github.com/MaddyMicrosoft) in [Azure#620](https://redirect.github.com/Azure/login/pull/620)\n- Add version support policy and security update guidance by [@&#8203;Alex-AZPS](https://redirect.github.com/Alex-AZPS) in [Azure#604](https://redirect.github.com/Azure/login/pull/604)\n\n**Full Changelog**: <https://github.com/Azure/login/compare/v3.0.1...v3.1.0>\n\n</details>\n\n---\n\n### Configuration\n\n📅 **Schedule**: (UTC)\n\n- Branch creation\n  - Between 12:00 AM and 03:59 AM, only on Monday (`* 0-3 * * 1`)\n- Automerge\n  - At any time (no schedule defined)\n\n🚦 **Automerge**: Disabled by config. Please merge this manually once you are satisfied.\n\n♻ **Rebasing**: Whenever PR becomes conflicted, or you tick the rebase/retry checkbox.\n\n🔕 **Ignore**: Close this PR and you won't be reminded about this update again.\n\n---\n\n - [ ] <!-- rebase-check -->If you want to rebase/retry this PR, check this box\n\n---\n\nThis PR was generated by [Mend Renovate](https://mend.io/renovate/). View the [repository job log](https://developer.mend.io/github/astral-sh/uv).\n<!--renovate-debug:eyJjcmVhdGVkSW5WZXIiOiI0NC4xMTIuMCIsInVwZGF0ZWRJblZlciI6IjQ0LjExMi4wIiwidGFyZ2V0QnJhbmNoIjoibWFpbiIsImxhYmVscyI6WyJidWlsZDpza2lwLWRvY2tlciIsImJ1aWxkOnNraXAtcmVsZWFzZSIsImludGVybmFsIl19-->\n",
