      "patch_url": "https://github.com/astral-sh/uv/pull/22018.patch",
      "merged_at": null
    },
    "body": "## Summary\n\nAllow `uv sync --frozen` to discover `uv.lock` when the workspace manifest is unavailable. We emit a preview warning unless `--preview-features frozen-lockfile` is enabled. When the workspace manifest is present, we use its configuration, including source mappings for extra build dependencies. When a member manifest remains available, its build dependency sources are also used.\n\nLockfile-only sync requires revision 5 or later and uses the selected member's recorded default groups and group Python requirements, matching frozen sync with a manifest. Non-project workspace roots require explicit group selection because their defaults are not recorded, and their group-specific Python requirements are also unavailable. Local packages still need their source trees and build metadata to be installed.\n\nThis also enables `uv workspace metadata --frozen --sync` without a workspace manifest.\n",
    "closed_by": null,
