    "body": "## Summary\n\nAllow `uv workspace metadata --frozen` to discover `uv.lock` when the workspace manifest is unavailable. We emit a preview warning unless `--preview-features frozen-lockfile` is enabled. We discover an existing environment relative to the lockfile and include its environment metadata and module ownership.\n\nLockfile-only metadata requires revision 5 or later. `--sync` requires the workspace manifest in this PR; [#22018](https://github.com/astral-sh/uv/pull/22018) adds support for syncing without it.\n",
