      "merged_at": "2026-09-30T01:30:08Z"
    },
    "body": "## Summary\n\n`uv sync --package member` uses the selected member's default dependency groups, but adding `--frozen` makes us use the defaults of the project we're running from instead.\n\nFor example, when run from a workspace root whose defaults are `[\"dev\"]`, we select `dev` even if the requested member's defaults are `[\"docs\"]`. The same package selection can therefore install different dependencies depending on whether you pass `--frozen`.\n\nFor revision 5 and later lockfiles, frozen sync uses the selected member's recorded default groups and group Python requirements, including when the member's manifest is missing.\n",
    "closed_by": {
